logind in place of ConsoleKit: the session object to listen to for Lock
and Unlock (loginctl lock-session, unlock-session) comes from logind's
GetSessionByPID instead of ConsoleKit's GetCurrentSession.  logind has no
ActiveChanged signal, so the screensaver no longer pauses while another
session is in front.

